### Retrieve documents
POST {{url}}/zia-rag/api/v1/retrieval/documents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What is the capital of France?",
  "config": {
    "topK": 2,
    "searchMode": "HYBRID",
    "useReranker": true
  }
}

### Retrieve documents (BM25 only, filtered)
POST {{url}}/zia-rag/api/v1/retrieval/documents
Blue: {{blueToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What is the capital of France?",
  "config": {
    "topK": 5,
    "searchMode": "VECTOR",
    "useReranker": true,
    "contentContains": "",
    "metadataFilters": {
      "source": ["acor"],
      "file_name" : ["318_104_01_f_DR_01.01.2026"]
    }
  }
}


### Retrieve documents (FILTER mode, no question, no embedding)
